OPSPILOT OPEN-SOURCE LICENSE NOTICE

The open-source license for OpsPilot is currently pending formal selection and approval by the project owner.

Please refer to:
  docs/decisions/ADR-0013-open-source-license-selection.md

for the comparative analysis between MIT, Apache-2.0, and AGPL-3.0 licenses, alongside the architectural recommendations.

Until an open-source license is formally accepted and ratified in ADR-0013, all rights are reserved by the OpsPilot contributors.
